OL,3,GNEWSAGaming lounge ordered to close for
OL,4,Atwo months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gaming lounge in Leicester has been
OL,7,Fordered to close for two months over
OL,8,Fconcerns about anti-social behaviour
OL,9,Flinked to the premises.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Police said the closure
OL,12,Forder was granted for Aim Quest Lounge,
OL,13,Fin Belgrave Gate, until 3 November.
OL,15,FThe force said officers presented
OL,16,Fevidence to Leicester Magistrates'
OL,17,FCourt that "activity associated with
OL,18,Fthe location was having a significant
OL,19,Fnegative impact on local residents and
OL,20,Fbusinesses".
